name: Hieroglyph — lower ante
author: corpus
description: >-
  Hieroglyph lowers the current Ante by 1 but reduces hands per round by 1. First-shop
  scaling tool: pair with high-value hands, Burglar to offset hand loss, and The Wall/
  boss-killer setups.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: Hieroglyph
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: Burglar
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Acrobat
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Dusk
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
